The emoji pictures in this folder are Microsoft Fluent Emoji
(https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji), 3D style, licensed under the MIT License, a copy of which sits
beside this file. Taken at commit 1ffb34c752ecf5d402f04cfb4b392c77f57c54bc.

Every emoji Fluent draws is taken, in its default skin tone, scaled to 64px and laid
10 by 10 into WebP sheets. Names, groups and search words come from each
emoji's Fluent metadata; the order is Unicode's, read from emojibase-data@16.0.3
(https://github.com/milesj/emojibase, MIT).

packages/shared/kit/src/emojis/fluent-3d-table.ts lists them in sheet order.

Regenerate with: node tools/fetch-fluent-emoji-3d.mts (needs git, cwebp and ffmpeg)
